# Turbulent Fen's ruling: "If this land enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of lands your opponents
# control, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped."
# Show and Tell puts Bot1's Fen and Bot2's eighth Forest onto the battlefield at once, and each entering permanent is
# judged against the game before any of them moves (CR 614.12, 101.4): Bot2 controls seven lands at that moment, so
# Fen enters tapped. A count that saw the Forest arriving beside it would find eight and leave Fen untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Turbulent Fen
Show and Tell
Island x5
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x7
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T15 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: {U})
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: {U})
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: {U})
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Turbulent Fen)
Bot2.Choose(Forest)

[Expect]
Turn = 15
Bot1.Battlefield.Turbulent Fen.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 8
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 8
